<title>USA: Union Area SD, Pa., won by Boenning &amp; Scattergood.</title>
<headline>Union Area SD, Pa., won by Boenning &amp; Scattergood.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boenning &amp; Scattergood, Inc it won $6.56 million of Union Area School District, Pa., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.35 percent without insurance recalculation.</p>
</text>
